{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わったわけじゃないんだけれども、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいつもの日記を更新しますよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、昨日幕張で行われた全国握手会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログで「ライブは休むかもだけど、確実に握手会は参加するーっ」て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お返事しておいて、欠席した件について。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、テストがお昼に終わるから、それから参加するつもりでいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話し合いの結果、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はテストを受けライブにも握手会にも参加しない、って結論になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてくださっていたひめきゅんのみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がっかりさせちゃって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当にごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"７月2日は私のお誕生日なんですけど、お祝いしてくれますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとーう＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんねブログにメッセージ書くの過ぎちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも２日にちゃーんと(おめでとう！)って思いながら過ごしたもーんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月３日誕生日なんだよ〜(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとーう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かに座だねー？うんーかわいいっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日、夏休み、夏は楽しいこといっぱいだね！えんじょいするしかー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕誕生日が７月５日なんやけど祝って(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとーうっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんさんでお誕生日近い人いっぱいおったね！素敵よー∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね///一緒に素敵ないちねんにしましょーう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは サータアンダギー好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれだよねー沖縄名物のお菓子だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんあれ食べたことないの('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドーナツみたいな味なんだろうなーとかおもいながら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはカープは好きですか？教えて下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元愛ねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校の授業とかで、カープの歴史とか習ったりするのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったら応援せんにゃいけーんってなるよね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの周りはカープファンもおったし、他の球団のファンもちらほら...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは雨の日は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の日はあんま好きくないです('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかく頑張ってアイロンしても湿気で髪がごわごわなるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傘さしたら片手ふさがっちゃうし、靴下びしょびしょなるし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、いっこ雨が降ったときのいいことといえば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生ん時はグランドで体育できないからって、体育館でドッジになったこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...くらい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がきんちょやあ(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気は何が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晴れ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晴れの好きなとこ挙げます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかい、空が明るいと何となくテンションあがる、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達に両手で手振れる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめさんはメガネかけてる人って好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ぶち茶ぶち青ふち、すき(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは夏が似合うイメージだけど夏は好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虫さんが冬眠してくれたら大好きよ。蚊、蝉、とかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと暑すぎるのも苦手。寒過ぎるのよりは耐えられるけれどもー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水族館と動物園どっち派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物園派!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aqua Timez　って知ってるかな？知ってたら何の曲が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近好きだよ！鉄板の「虹」とかいい曲＼(∀)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかにおすすめの曲ありますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｖ系的な暗め＆激しい曲って好き？何か聴いたりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんま聴いたことないかも(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｖ系な感じのはあんま詳しくないのです←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るめで激しめな曲なら聴くかもだなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はわりと激しくない感じの歌をひっそり聴いてるかもしれないー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HardRock系のバンドってどう思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっくいー(^^)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼のPVでみんながパンクスに変身しとったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな感じでロックユニット組めそうなよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂×ロック..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいじゃーん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番聴いてみたい音楽のジャンルは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞がじーんってくるバラードか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってて聴いてて元気になるような超アップテンポな曲!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブってどんな気持ちで歌っとるん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンの時とのいちばんの違いは、目の前にお客さんがいること。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人によるもんだろうけど、ひめたんにはそれがいい緊張になるの(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで自然と笑顔になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのいっちばんの心からの笑顔は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってるときにでてくるもんだと思っとるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、だからっていつも作ってないけれども(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん(*´・ω・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/4515943/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}